            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nA pleasant surprise\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe arrived here by accident and were glad that this happened. \n\nThe restaurant is on the 2nd floor. Upon entering I was impressed by the look. Table cloths, real napkins and high back red chairs. \n\nWe ordered noodles with seafood. Also prawns. Both were attractively presented and both were very tasty. \n\nService was efficient, friendly and professional. \n\nPrices are fairly expensive. \n\nI am concerned that we were the only patrons on a Thursday evening before 8 PM That is not a good sign.\nRead more\nWritten December 26, 2019\nThai Village Restaurant - Vietnam\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're delighted you enjoyed the food. Hope to welcome you back soon!\nWritten July 28, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
